    "id": "tool:read-public-web-page",
    "label": "Read a public web page",
    "job": "Open one public web page and return its title, readable text, links, the card it describes itself with, every picture and video it declares and its structured data",
    "description": "Reads one public HTTP or HTTPS page and returns its title, readable text and links, and the card it describes itself with: its picture, description, site name and icon (each null when the page does not say), every picture (images) and video (videos) it declares in its tags and structured data, and that structured data (data, its schema.org JSON-LD objects). It reaches public sites only (the engine judges every address, every redirect and every address a name resolves to), follows a small number of redirects, limits the response to 2 MB and returns at most 30,000 text characters and 100 links. It does not sign in or reuse browser cookies.",
    "status": "active",
